 *
 *   - pin=`pinned`  : strict — no live extras, no defect. pinned artifact → PASS.
 *   - pin=`older`   : strict vs an older draft — a pinned artifact drifts on
 *                     every pinned-only field. → FAIL (drift). The proof.
 *   - pin=`live`    : current — a live artifact drifts by zero. → PASS.
